{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07641","headline":"伤情 · 孟云卿","name":"伤情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲长心易忧，早孤意常伤。\n出门先踌躇，入户亦彷徨。\n此生一何苦，前事安可忘。\n兄弟先我没，孤幼盈我傍。\n旧居近东南，河水新爲梁。\n松柏今在兹，安忍思故乡。\n四时与日月，万物各有常。\n秋风已一起，草木无不霜。\n行行当自勉，不忍再思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}